                                                "sense_id": "f9638430-3235-37db-83ea-f997494a2a55",
                                                "text": "Two senior USAid security officials were suspended on Sunday for blocking Doge officials from a restricted area, a day after the agency’s website went offline, and Musk posted to X that USAid was “beyond repair” and needed to be shut down."
                                            }
                                        ]
